The SGI O2 uses proprietary 'QIMMs' (DIMM's using dual-stacked contact fingers, 
similar to an AGP slot's).  Indigo2's use fairly standard.  Sun Ultra5/10 as 
well as certain Cisco router RSP's/SUP's/GRP's also use these.
